# EventCalendar Cursor Rules

## Project Context
- Two UI implementations: `:compose` and `:xml`.
- KMP-ready architecture (no platform-specific date APIs in common logic).
- Min SDK 23.

## Instruction Modules
Open these files to provide context for your current task:
- Architecture: `.agents/core/architecture.md`
- Compose: `.agents/modules/compose.md`
- XML: `.agents/modules/xml.md`
- Logic: `.agents/features/calendar-logic.md`

## Coding Standards
- Use `kotlinx-datetime`. Avoid `java.time` in UI layers.
- Use `internal` visibility for all non-entry point components.
- Resource-based localization for day/month names.
- Surgical edits only. Do not perform unrelated refactors.
